        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-019108",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-24",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "The largest segment of the United States IT market that we operate within is served by local and regional value-added resellers, or VARs, many of whom engage in the sales of hardware and software products, as well as higher-margin IT services.",
