        "filing_date": "2026-02-24",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We actively work with our existing customers to become their IT provider of choice for products and enhanced solution services, while seeking to ensure our reputation of high-quality support, tailored marketing programs, and competitive pricing that lead the way to expanding our share of the overall IT market we serve.",
